          "E. Write an 80 to 120 word text where you can state a situation where you consider people to be rude or with lack of manners. What do they do that you cannot stand? How does this situation make you feel? What reactions does it create generally on people? Do not leave any detail out.",
          "Let’s Talk",
          "Let’s Write"
